# NIC-Strelka — the Belka's own options.

config STRELKA_SENSOR_FLPR
	bool "The sensor read by the FLPR"
	default y
	help
	  The sensor set and read by the nRF54LM20A's RISC-V coprocessor, firmware/flpr, its samples
	  handed over in a ring in shared RAM (FIRMWARE.md, The sensor on the FLPR). Off, the main
	  core reads it, src/imu.c: the fallback, built with boards/sensor_on_app.overlay laid over
	  boards/flpr.overlay (firmware/README.md, Building).

config STRELKA_KRYSKA
	bool "Built for Kryska"
	default n
	help
	  The unit says itself Kryska in 64/0's kind (COMMANDS.md): set by kryska.conf, its SD NAND
	  served as the Belka's card, and by kryska_nor.conf, its other way, the NOR flash
	  (chapters/kryska-memory.md).

config STRELKA_CELL_EMPTY_MV
	int "The cell's end voltage, mV"
	default 3100
	help
	  Under it for ten seconds running, the record is closed and the unit goes off: the
	  Belka's LiFePO4 cell at 3,10 V (PARTS.md, The cells); Kryska's 3,30 V until its cell is
	  chosen (kryska.conf). The fuel gauge's 0 % is not trusted until the cell's own model is
	  made (FIRMWARE.md, The PMIC).

config STRELKA_BUCK2_PWM_RECORDING
	bool "BUCK2 forced into PWM while a record runs"
	default n
	help
	  Kryska's module runs on the PMIC's BUCK2: forced into PWM from a record's start, its
	  ripple some 5 mVpp against 50 in its automatic mode's hysteresis at a light load (the
	  nPM1300's product specification v1.1, 6.3.6), Nordic's mode for the radio's sake; handed
	  back to its automatic mode at the record's end (FIRMWARE.md, The PMIC). The Belka's bucks
	  are unused.

# The SDK's MCUmgr reboot hook, on by default on the nRF54L series whenever MPSL is in, calls
# mpsl_uninit() before a reset, and links a part of libmpsl that asks for two callbacks MPSL's
# FEM-only cut leaves out. It has no prompt; given one here, as Nordic advised (DevZone 129531),
# prj.conf turns it off: MPSL never started, there is nothing to uninitialise (FIRMWARE.md, The
# platform).
config MCUMGR_GRP_OS_REBOOT_BT
	bool "Disable Bluetooth/MPSL before MCUmgr reboot"

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
